WEBVTT

00:00.310 --> 00:04.310
<b>Episode 7: Lockscreen with Him</b>

00:08.010 --> 00:09.750
<i>Looks: A+!</i>

00:08.520 --> 00:10.230
<b>Looks A+</b>

00:11.420 --> 00:13.240
<i>Body: A+!</i>

00:11.780 --> 00:13.240
<b>Body A+</b>

00:15.140 --> 00:17.070
<i>Personality: A+!</i>

00:16.280 --> 00:17.490
<b>Personality A+
(On the outside)</b>

00:17.940 --> 00:21.510
<i>Mona Kawai, seventeen years old. 
Osaka born and bred.</i>

00:22.000 --> 00:25.420
<i>A girl who charms as easily as she breathes.</i>

00:25.420 --> 00:27.250
<i>It's been a year since I moved to Tokyo.</i>

00:32.010 --> 00:35.320
<i>And in my high school life, 
it's me for the win!</i>

01:02.450 --> 01:02.870
<b>m 82 222 l 159 118 327 136 364 231 332 300 146 325</b>

01:02.450 --> 01:02.870
<b>Medaka!</b>

01:03.120 --> 01:03.870
<b>m 255 63 l 290 32 404 38 432 83 404 116 286 114</b>

01:03.120 --> 01:03.870
<b>Why are you
always so mean
to Mona-chan?</b>

01:03.120 --> 01:03.870
<b>m 92 258 l 114 236 171 228 225 239 246 266 236 300 214 317 140 318 88 292</b>

01:03.120 --> 01:03.870
<b>Do your tenets
not tell you to be
nice to people?</b>

01:59.300 --> 02:05.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

01:59.300 --> 02:05.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

02:08.860 --> 02:11.850
The Ainu in Hokkaido call 
marimo moss "tarasampe."

02:11.850 --> 02:13.940
It means "lake goblins."

02:13.940 --> 02:16.400
What are you doing to my phone?

02:16.800 --> 02:20.420
Be grateful. I hooked you up 
with the best lockscreen.

02:24.890 --> 02:26.960
Wh-What's with this wallpaper?!

02:26.960 --> 02:29.700
It'd do you good to look at more pervy stuff.

02:29.700 --> 02:32.670
True. He hasn't developed any resistance to it.

02:33.080 --> 02:34.130
I can't.

02:34.130 --> 02:35.570
Tenets, schmenets.

02:35.570 --> 02:36.840
You can't even look at pics?

02:43.630 --> 02:45.340
I gotta take care of something.

02:45.340 --> 02:46.830
Aww...

02:46.830 --> 02:49.730
Actually, I think he was peeking 
at it through his fingers.

02:51.930 --> 02:54.980
<i>A monk-in-training 
has no need for these things.</i>

02:54.980 --> 02:56.900
<i>I should delete it.</i>

02:57.800 --> 02:58.960
<i>Delete it...</i>

02:59.480 --> 03:00.500
<i>Delete it now!</i>

03:05.390 --> 03:08.580
Whatcha staring at, Haruno-san?

03:08.580 --> 03:13.120
Well, I was just wondering which one to pick.

03:13.120 --> 03:16.880
I'm thinking of sending 
Kuroiwa-kun a cute pic of you.

03:17.180 --> 03:19.300
Huh? Why me?

03:19.580 --> 03:24.880
I mean, Asahi-chan's able to just 
waltz into our classroom these days.

03:24.880 --> 03:29.140
A rival in love of yours 
is a rival of mine too.

03:29.410 --> 03:31.360
You consider her a rival?

03:31.360 --> 03:33.230
Yep. Besides...

03:33.750 --> 03:34.680
Asahi!

03:33.810 --> 03:36.900
<b>Sparkle <3</b>

03:33.810 --> 03:36.900
<b>Sparkle <3</b>

03:34.680 --> 03:36.900
Drop the sparkle. It's annoying.

03:36.900 --> 03:40.400
We even went to check on 
Kuroiwa-senpai together yesterday.

03:41.510 --> 03:42.520
Hey!

03:42.520 --> 03:43.280
Huh?

03:43.280 --> 03:47.920
<i>No fair! She hasn't even 
called me "Tsubomi" yet!</i>

03:47.920 --> 03:49.330
<i>Oh, the jealousy!</i>

03:49.860 --> 03:52.750
As an OG fan, I can't lose.

03:52.750 --> 03:53.700
OG...?

03:53.700 --> 03:55.330
Whatever, sent!

03:55.330 --> 03:58.490
This should help you take 
Kuroiwa-kun for yourself!

03:58.490 --> 04:00.840
Uh, I'm not exactly trying to.

04:01.890 --> 04:04.750
<i>But this might be a good plan, actually.</i>

04:04.750 --> 04:08.470
<i>I hear there are times when a third party 
makes people notice how they feel.</i>

04:08.730 --> 04:10.940
What did you send him, by the way?

04:10.940 --> 04:12.040
Well, it was...

04:12.350 --> 04:13.460
this one!

04:14.920 --> 04:17.620
Squee, how cute!

04:18.640 --> 04:21.530
<i>Wh-What's with that look? 
Who's that supposed to be?!</i>

04:21.530 --> 04:23.780
<i>Why am I lookin' at him like that?!</i>

04:24.400 --> 04:27.240
Y-You sent this to Kuroiwa-kun?

04:27.240 --> 04:30.490
Yep! It's the best shot, if I do say so myself.

04:30.490 --> 04:33.940
<i>Anyone who sees this is </i>sure<i> to misunderstand!</i>

04:33.940 --> 04:37.250
<i>Asahi havin' the wrong idea 
is bad enough already!</i>

04:37.690 --> 04:39.870
Unsend that message! Now!

04:39.870 --> 04:40.670
Huh?

04:40.670 --> 04:42.760
Unsend, unsend!

04:43.210 --> 04:47.260
<i>That ain't me! I'd never make a face like that!</i>

04:47.660 --> 04:50.010
If you say so...

04:50.740 --> 04:51.440
Oh.

04:52.110 --> 04:54.060
I'm out of battery.

04:54.060 --> 04:57.400
S-Sorry about that. Would you 
have preferred that I didn't?

04:57.400 --> 04:59.660
What do I do now?!

04:59.660 --> 05:02.280
I-It's okay. Don't worry about it.

05:02.740 --> 05:05.030
<i>There's more than one way to deal with this.</i>

05:06.900 --> 05:09.530
<i>I just gotta get to it before he sees it...</i>

05:11.820 --> 05:15.370
<i>and delete it from his phone!</i>

05:15.710 --> 05:17.420
<i>Where's Medaka?!</i>

05:17.420 --> 05:18.750
Oh, hey, Mona-chan.

05:19.710 --> 05:22.050
Mona-chan, you're so cute!

05:22.050 --> 05:24.630
Whoa, Mona-chan's running.

05:30.890 --> 05:34.330
<i>I'll look at it one last time 
and then delete it.</i>

05:34.330 --> 05:36.890
<i>It's okay as long as I delete it right after.</i>

05:37.900 --> 05:40.400
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

05:37.900 --> 05:40.400
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

05:37.900 --> 05:40.400
<b>Notification

Tsubomi Haruno
sent an image.</b>

05:38.680 --> 05:40.400
<i>Hm? Haruno-san?</i>

05:40.400 --> 05:42.230
Oh, Kuroiwa-kun!

05:45.010 --> 05:50.000
<i>No. People might see the 
lockscreen if I do it here.</i>

05:52.570 --> 05:56.260
<i>Oh, come on. Where is he?</i>

05:56.260 --> 05:58.170
What's up, Mona-chan?

05:58.170 --> 06:00.810
Uh, have you seen Kuroiwa-kun?

06:00.810 --> 06:03.340
Yeah, he went that way.

06:08.510 --> 06:11.660
<i>Okay, nobody's around.</i>

06:12.510 --> 06:13.220
<b>badump</b>

06:13.140 --> 06:13.850
<b>badump</b>

06:13.760 --> 06:14.470
<b>badump</b>

06:14.110 --> 06:16.480
T-Time to see.

06:14.390 --> 06:15.100
<b>badump</b>

06:19.480 --> 06:21.690
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

06:19.480 --> 06:21.690
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

06:19.480 --> 06:21.690
<b>Notification

Tsubomi Haruno
sent an image.</b>

06:19.740 --> 06:21.630
<i>I'll check that later.</i>

06:24.480 --> 06:25.970
Kuroiwa-kun!

06:26.670 --> 06:28.280
Wh-Who?

06:31.100 --> 06:32.240
Kuroiwa-kun!

06:32.640 --> 06:33.820
Don't.

06:37.340 --> 06:38.510
You can't look at it.

06:39.920 --> 06:42.920
I didn't, I swear!

06:44.030 --> 06:48.070
I'm here to delete the message 
Haruno-san sent you by mistake.

06:48.930 --> 06:52.930
<i>Great, he hasn't opened it yet. 
Time to delete.</i>

06:54.550 --> 06:57.350
Kuroiwa-kun, I'm putting it 
back to the home scr—

07:06.450 --> 07:07.440
<i>Did she see?</i>

07:07.440 --> 07:08.670
<i>She saw, didn't she?</i>

07:08.670 --> 07:10.060
<i>It just had to be a girl...</i>

07:10.060 --> 07:12.570
<i>And a cute girl like Mona-chan, of all people!</i>

07:12.990 --> 07:17.310
I-It's not what it looks like! 
Sho changed it without asking!

07:25.500 --> 07:27.400
Here you are.

07:35.460 --> 07:38.960
What emotion was that expression conveying?

07:45.780 --> 07:48.920
What's with his lockscreen?

07:50.650 --> 07:53.580
I'm cuter, y'know?

08:02.290 --> 08:05.460
<b>staaaaaaaaaaaaaaare</b>

08:02.730 --> 08:05.460
<i>H-Her gaze hurts.</i>

08:06.040 --> 08:10.660
<i>Seems that pic was just 
a boys-being-boys thing,</i>

08:10.660 --> 08:13.220
<i>but he sure didn't seem to mind lookin' at it.</i>

08:13.220 --> 08:18.970
<i>It makes no sense when I'm tryin' this 
hard and he still won't succumb to me.</i>

08:19.500 --> 08:21.550
<i>This is an outrage!</i>

08:20.730 --> 08:23.800
Hey, he really changed his lockscreen back.

08:23.800 --> 08:26.280
After I went through all that trouble!

08:27.130 --> 08:29.280
Never do that again.

08:29.280 --> 08:31.960
You infected me with some bad vibes.

08:31.960 --> 08:36.740
I refuse. A boy's lockscreen 
needs to be a pretty girl.

08:38.990 --> 08:42.640
Heck, it doesn't have to be a pin-up. 
Just make it a girl.

08:42.640 --> 08:47.940
Your lockscreen always being some furball 
is boring. For me, myself, and moi.

08:47.940 --> 08:50.090
Medaka-kun sure does love cats.

08:50.090 --> 08:51.840
Never mind all that. Give it back.

08:51.840 --> 08:56.060
<i>N-No! Is he gonna change it to 
some other broad's pic again?</i>

08:56.060 --> 08:58.100
<i>A pretty girl, you say?</i>

08:58.450 --> 09:00.850
<i>W-Well, look no further!</i>

09:01.160 --> 09:04.060
<i>I'm sittin' right next to you!</i>

09:04.060 --> 09:05.230
<b>beep</b>

09:05.850 --> 09:07.480
<b>ping</b>

09:07.850 --> 09:09.310
<b>DUN</b>

09:10.650 --> 09:14.570
Aw, shucks. I sent that by mistake.

09:15.180 --> 09:18.780
But... Feel free to use it 
as your lockscreen, though.

09:19.440 --> 09:21.720
Whoa, a Mona-chan selfie?!

09:21.720 --> 09:23.040
So cute.

09:23.040 --> 09:24.740
No fair, Medaka!

09:24.740 --> 09:26.160
<i>How d'you like </i>them<i> apples?!</i>

09:26.160 --> 09:29.670
<b>Mona Kawai</b>

09:26.160 --> 09:29.670
<b>Today</b>

09:27.670 --> 09:29.040
<b></b>Delete image?

09:27.670 --> 09:29.040
<b></b>Cancel    Delete

09:29.670 --> 09:31.220
Hey!

09:29.670 --> 09:35.170
Clear mind, clear spirit...

09:31.220 --> 09:32.740
What a waste.

09:35.480 --> 09:38.110
<i>Wha... Why'd you delete it?!</i>

09:38.110 --> 09:40.450
<i>Was it not cute enough?!</i>

09:40.450 --> 09:44.410
<i>Crud. What kinda pic 
should I have sent, then?!</i>

09:44.410 --> 09:46.010
Mona-chan.

09:49.620 --> 09:50.980
A pumpkin?

09:50.980 --> 09:54.020
Yep! They were handing these out 
outside the station.

09:54.020 --> 09:55.660
Halloween's coming up, after all.

09:55.660 --> 09:58.240
Halloween? Oh, you're right.

09:58.840 --> 10:06.370
So, about that. I'd like to take 
some cute pics of you in costume.

10:06.370 --> 10:08.370
<i>Th-That's it!</i>

10:08.760 --> 10:10.770
<i>Halloween's just what I need!</i>

10:10.770 --> 10:15.630
<i>The perfect event to get him 
to make me his lockscreen!</i>

10:15.960 --> 10:17.480
Thanks, Haruno-san!

10:18.920 --> 10:22.140
Hey, listen up! How about 
we do a Halloween party?

10:23.000 --> 10:24.930
A... A party with Mona-chan?

10:24.930 --> 10:26.390
Is food included?

10:26.390 --> 10:28.900
Squee! Count Haruno in!

10:28.900 --> 10:30.400
And me too!

10:30.680 --> 10:32.690
Why don't we do it at my place, then?

10:32.690 --> 10:34.480
It's big enough to party.

10:34.480 --> 10:35.470
Approved.

10:35.470 --> 10:37.530
You're in too, right, Medaka-kun?

10:37.530 --> 10:39.610
Huh? Nah, I'll...

10:39.930 --> 10:42.650
What? You're not joining us?

10:42.650 --> 10:45.620
Too bad, so sad!

10:46.290 --> 10:47.640
Join us.

10:47.640 --> 10:48.870
Okay?

10:49.310 --> 10:50.170
'Kay.

10:50.580 --> 10:54.680
Yay! The more the merrier!

10:55.540 --> 10:57.760
<i>Halloween and costumes go hand-in-hand.</i>

10:57.760 --> 11:01.510
<i>I'll wear one Medaka likes 
and charm his socks off.</i>

11:01.510 --> 11:04.470
<i>But what'd be good?</i>

11:04.760 --> 11:07.880
<i>What'd make him want to 
make me his lockscreen?</i>

11:07.880 --> 11:11.730
<i>I've already done bunny girl and nurse, too.</i>

11:11.730 --> 11:15.050
<i>Hmm... I'd like a chance to get 
to know Medaka better.</i>

11:15.050 --> 11:17.460
We'll buy the treats on the day.

11:17.460 --> 11:19.310
I'll help decorate.

11:19.310 --> 11:20.490
So, hey.

11:20.490 --> 11:22.640
I have another suggestion.

11:36.220 --> 11:38.250
When will Mona-chan get here?

11:38.250 --> 11:39.630
So many people.

11:39.630 --> 11:41.550
Well, it <i>is</i> Saturday.

11:43.050 --> 11:44.760
Cute!

11:44.760 --> 11:45.740
Picks for this season?

11:45.740 --> 11:46.600
<i>Maritai,</i> I guess?

11:46.900 --> 11:49.530
We'll get to see Mona-chan 
out of uniform for the first time!

11:49.530 --> 11:51.550
You're right, actually.

11:51.550 --> 11:55.360
Wonder what her style is. Something like that?

11:56.690 --> 12:00.150
<i>Day after day,</i>

12:00.400 --> 12:02.040
Hey, that'd be cool.

12:00.570 --> 12:03.160
<i>I'm so pretty.</i>

12:02.040 --> 12:04.240
But that classy look 
would be great on her, too.

12:03.830 --> 12:07.160
<i>Day after day,</i>

12:07.580 --> 12:09.700
<i>I'm so pretty.</i>

12:07.640 --> 12:11.750
Gosh, Mona-chan might even 
be able to pull <i>that</i> off!

12:10.500 --> 12:14.670
<i>Very, very pretty Mona!</i>

12:16.080 --> 12:19.990
Whoa... But wait, that's just your fantasy.

12:21.150 --> 12:24.060
<i>Sh-Shopping with girls out of uniform?</i>

12:24.060 --> 12:26.140
Is this like a group date or something?

12:26.140 --> 12:28.510
We're just here to check out costumes, man.

12:28.830 --> 12:30.520
Oh, it's Haruno-san.

12:30.520 --> 12:33.160
Sorry for keeping you waiting.

12:33.160 --> 12:35.220
Huh? Is Mona-chan not here?

12:35.220 --> 12:36.020
Nope.

12:36.520 --> 12:39.650
She says she was nearby... Oh.

12:57.620 --> 12:58.500
Whew.

12:58.500 --> 13:00.810
Cute!

12:59.750 --> 13:01.840
Over here, Mona-chan.

13:03.740 --> 13:05.730
You're all early.

13:05.730 --> 13:07.890
You look so good in casual wear.

13:08.180 --> 13:10.000
May I take a picture?

13:10.000 --> 13:10.970
Go for it.

13:12.670 --> 13:13.830
Bravo!

13:13.830 --> 13:14.900
Amazing!

13:14.900 --> 13:17.730
Clear mind, clear spirit.

13:17.730 --> 13:21.610
<i>I'll figure out what kinda costume 
Medaka likes today!</i>

13:21.930 --> 13:24.260
Let's hit the stores, yeah?

13:24.260 --> 13:26.820
Hold up. I invited one more.

13:26.820 --> 13:28.080
Oh, there she is.

13:28.080 --> 13:28.870
Huh?

13:28.870 --> 13:30.890
Sorry I'm late.

13:31.900 --> 13:33.350
Asahi?!

13:34.170 --> 13:35.890
I invited her.

13:35.890 --> 13:39.040
You two are friends, and I saw her scoping 
things out from outside the classroom.

13:39.630 --> 13:45.130
I don't particularly care for Halloween 
or anything, but this seemed fun.

13:45.130 --> 13:48.130
<i>Eavesdropping again, were we?</i>

13:48.490 --> 13:50.380
Oh, Shonan-san.

13:51.700 --> 13:54.040
H-H-Hello, Kuroiwa-senpai!

13:54.040 --> 13:56.810
I... I don't look weird, do I?

13:56.810 --> 13:58.760
Huh? No?

13:58.760 --> 14:01.810
<i>She's just here to see Medaka!</i>

14:01.810 --> 14:04.600
All right, let's go!

14:04.600 --> 14:09.920
Hi... Hey, let's be friends. 
I'm Tsubomi Haruno.

14:09.920 --> 14:12.360
Oh, I'm Asahi Shonan.

14:12.360 --> 14:13.240
Um...

14:13.600 --> 14:17.130
For the record, I've been a fan 
much longer. I'm an OG, okay?

14:17.130 --> 14:20.020
Make sure you don't leave me out of things!

14:20.020 --> 14:21.050
O... G?

14:24.630 --> 14:27.010
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

14:29.640 --> 14:32.010
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

14:39.050 --> 14:40.900
That's a specialty costume store for you.

14:40.900 --> 14:43.200
There's a lot.

14:43.200 --> 14:45.060
It'll be hard to pick with so many.

14:45.060 --> 14:46.940
Wanna split up to check?

14:46.940 --> 14:49.150
Sounds good. Boy and girl groups?

14:49.150 --> 14:53.400
Yeah, grab what you like 
and meet up by the fitting rooms.

14:53.400 --> 14:54.660
Okay!

14:54.660 --> 14:57.130
Hmm, what should I go with?

14:57.130 --> 14:59.680
Looks like a bunch of options over there.

14:59.680 --> 15:00.960
Mona-chan!

15:00.960 --> 15:04.630
These'll look great on you. Try 'em on.

15:07.910 --> 15:10.760
Go, go, fight!

15:08.890 --> 15:11.590
Eek! So cute!

15:12.250 --> 15:13.900
Trendy 1920s look, anyone?

15:13.900 --> 15:15.760
Whoo! So dreamy!

15:16.630 --> 15:18.810
Mona-ook-ook!

15:18.810 --> 15:21.650
Ook, ook! You look great 
in animal costumes too!

15:21.940 --> 15:24.690
<i>Wait, this isn't what I'm here for!</i>

15:24.690 --> 15:27.710
Haruno-san, you gotta look 
for your own costume too.

15:27.710 --> 15:29.690
Oh, r-right.

15:29.970 --> 15:32.510
<i>I couldn't let her down...</i>

15:35.710 --> 15:39.450
<i>Asahi, I feel like I can hear 
what you're thinkin'.</i>

15:39.990 --> 15:44.710
<i>"Something sexy? Something cute? 
What would Senpai like?"</i>

15:45.180 --> 15:49.330
<i>As an expert, let me tell you 
that you ain't gettin' anywhere.</i>

15:49.330 --> 15:52.220
<i>You won't beat me and all 
my cosplayin' experience.</i>

15:52.220 --> 15:55.850
<i>So I won't gain anything stickin' around here.</i>

15:57.940 --> 16:01.100
"I don't know what to do anymore!"

16:01.910 --> 16:05.610
Beep-boop! I received your SOS signal.

16:07.320 --> 16:08.940
Or something.

16:08.940 --> 16:11.650
Minami! What are you doing here?

16:11.650 --> 16:15.450
I've been thinking since our 
last conversation, you see...

16:15.730 --> 16:19.800
Having balloon decorations would 
be nice for a Halloween party.

16:18.690 --> 16:20.580
A Halloween party, huh?

16:21.440 --> 16:24.170
Sounds fun. Wanna join them?

16:24.170 --> 16:29.960
Huh? I don't know about 
butting in on a class event.

16:31.410 --> 16:32.640
Sounds good.

16:32.640 --> 16:34.030
Right?

16:34.030 --> 16:37.730
According to a survey 
conducted on a hundred teens,

16:37.730 --> 16:41.980
the chances of a Halloween party 
sparking a romance is...

16:42.270 --> 16:44.710
approximately 45 percent.

16:46.040 --> 16:52.240
This is your chance to show off a costume 
that Kuroiwa-senpai might like.

16:55.490 --> 17:00.610
That said, I figured you'd be 
agonizing over what to wear.

17:00.610 --> 17:04.330
I also figured you'd come here for costumes, 
so I thought I'd take a look-see.

17:04.330 --> 17:07.760
You say that, but I think you're 
just here to laugh at me.

17:07.760 --> 17:09.750
Of course not!

17:10.280 --> 17:12.670
So, what should I go with?

17:13.310 --> 17:16.760
If you want the sneak-peek factor 
that boys love so much, this one.

17:19.490 --> 17:21.510
Nothing sneaky about a bare belly!

17:22.040 --> 17:25.760
How about this? No boy dislikes ramen.

17:26.220 --> 17:28.440
Why's the skirt slit?

17:29.410 --> 17:33.600
I hear a lot of boys first crushed 
on their preschool teacher,

17:33.400 --> 17:36.820
<b>Vehicles at Work!</b>

17:33.600 --> 17:35.040
so this might be good?

17:35.040 --> 17:36.820
Yeah, you're just messing around.

17:37.330 --> 17:39.650
None of these feel right.

17:39.650 --> 17:41.830
Which leaves...

17:43.830 --> 17:47.330
How about this? It'll suit you perfectly, 
since you're all cool-beautyish.

17:51.330 --> 17:52.340
<i>Found 'em.</i>

17:56.140 --> 17:57.560
I think I'll go with this.

17:57.560 --> 17:59.460
What's that have to do with Halloween?

17:59.460 --> 18:01.460
Us boys are fine with joke costumes.

18:01.460 --> 18:04.470
Yeah, the girls' costumes are the main event.

18:04.990 --> 18:08.600
Actually, what kinda girls' 
costumes do you like?

18:08.890 --> 18:12.100
<i>Let's go! I've been waitin' for that topic!</i>

18:12.100 --> 18:15.110
<i>It's best to get it straight 
from the horse's mouth!</i>

18:15.390 --> 18:17.930
<i>I'll see what he picks with my own eyes!</i>

18:17.930 --> 18:20.120
<i>Hurry up and choose, Medaka!</i>

18:23.620 --> 18:25.440
What's up, Medaka-kun?

18:25.440 --> 18:29.820
Dunno. Just felt like someone 
was staring at me.

18:29.820 --> 18:31.220
And who's this someone?

18:31.220 --> 18:32.380
<i>Crap!</i>

18:36.550 --> 18:38.840
<i>Ugh! What now?</i>

18:47.500 --> 18:50.400
I pick this one. It's sexy and stylish.

18:50.400 --> 18:52.880
I prefer this one.

18:52.880 --> 18:54.890
How about you, Medaka-kun?

18:57.770 --> 18:59.990
<i>Close call.</i>

18:59.990 --> 19:02.540
Yeah, I don't really...

19:02.540 --> 19:03.600
You wanna die?

19:03.600 --> 19:07.360
Now's not the time to play it cool, Medaka-kun.

19:07.360 --> 19:08.990
If you <i>had</i> to choose, what would it be?

19:08.990 --> 19:10.500
F-Fine...

19:13.200 --> 19:15.380
Probably this.

19:15.870 --> 19:17.210
<i>Wait, which one?</i>

19:17.210 --> 19:19.370
Yeah, that's a you choice, all right.

19:19.370 --> 19:23.010
I'd rather go with the one 
next to it, personally.

19:23.010 --> 19:25.470
Lay off. I'll go check the other areas.

19:28.220 --> 19:29.180
<i>Which one?</i>

19:29.180 --> 19:33.190
<i>Which one did he point at? 
He was looking in the direction of...</i>

19:35.820 --> 19:37.440
<i>Th-This thing?</i>

19:37.780 --> 19:39.900
<i>It's way too risqué!</i>

19:39.900 --> 19:42.200
<i>What? Did he really pick this?!</i>

19:42.770 --> 19:45.200
Mona-chan, did you find something?

19:45.200 --> 19:48.660
<i>Ugh... This is all to capture Medaka's heart!</i>

19:49.050 --> 19:50.850
Y-Yeah, I decided.

19:50.850 --> 19:54.080
I found one that's peak cuteness.

19:55.860 --> 19:58.090
Wh... Wha... Wha...

19:58.090 --> 20:00.650
What costumes did the three pick?

20:00.650 --> 20:02.430
Can't wait to see!

20:02.430 --> 20:04.620
Should we try ours too?

20:04.620 --> 20:06.520
Why would we?!

20:06.520 --> 20:07.850
Are you done?

20:08.300 --> 20:10.600
I... I'm done.

20:10.600 --> 20:12.880
Okay, Haruno-san goes first!

20:12.880 --> 20:14.100
Come on!

20:16.830 --> 20:19.110
I-I can't get comfy in this.

20:19.110 --> 20:22.080
Whoa, a fairy. You look great.

20:22.080 --> 20:23.490
R-Really?

20:23.490 --> 20:24.450
Nice!

20:24.450 --> 20:26.450
Next up, Shonan-san!

20:29.250 --> 20:31.450
Nice goth.

20:31.450 --> 20:33.180
Very nice!

20:33.180 --> 20:35.310
That's very nice and mature.

20:36.430 --> 20:38.220
Medaka-kun says you look great, too.

20:38.220 --> 20:39.720
I didn't...

20:39.720 --> 20:42.260
Last but not least, Mona-chan!

20:42.750 --> 20:45.010
O-Okay...

20:56.340 --> 20:57.890
How do I look?

20:57.890 --> 21:01.030
<i>Well? This is what you're into, right, Medaka?!</i>

21:01.030 --> 21:01.860
Ho—

21:01.860 --> 21:03.990
Cute!

21:04.590 --> 21:07.490
<i>Look! I'm catering to your tastes!</i>

21:07.490 --> 21:10.550
<i>Surely this will do it, right?</i>

21:12.610 --> 21:14.380
<i>Wait, what?</i>

21:14.380 --> 21:18.140
I thought that one was great too!

21:18.140 --> 21:18.580
Huh?

21:18.580 --> 21:23.780
Too bad, Medaka-kun. She didn't pick 
the one next to it that you liked.

21:23.780 --> 21:26.000
No need to mention that!

21:26.000 --> 21:29.260
<i>Th-The one... next to it?!</i>

21:29.540 --> 21:31.960
I didn't know Mona-chan 
was into that stuff, though.

21:31.960 --> 21:33.850
We have so much in common!

21:33.850 --> 21:35.790
Are there no lines you won't cross?

21:35.790 --> 21:38.060
<i>No... You've got it all wrong...</i>

21:39.060 --> 21:41.580
Wait! Let me get a better look!

21:41.580 --> 21:44.110
Mona-chan's so provocative!

21:44.110 --> 21:47.530
<i>This ain't what I'm into!</i>

21:52.290 --> 21:54.690
Come on, I was just kidding.

21:54.690 --> 21:56.740
I wouldn't dress up as a mummy.

21:56.740 --> 21:59.120
You'll see what I picked on the day.

21:59.120 --> 22:00.780
Oh, I get it now.

22:00.780 --> 22:02.900
I like it when you keep us in suspense, too.

22:02.900 --> 22:04.300
I can't wait!

22:04.590 --> 22:08.090
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit...</i>

22:08.510 --> 22:10.570
<i>I'm the queen bee!</i>

22:10.570 --> 22:12.540
<i>And I swear on my crown:</i>

22:12.540 --> 22:14.710
<i>I will taste victory this Halloween!</i>

23:45.020 --> 23:50.030
<b>Episode 8





Halloween with Him</b>

23:45.020 --> 23:50.030
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

23:47.020 --> 23:49.510
Next time: "Halloween with Him."
